  "description": "UI testing for Avalonia desktop apps: Playwright-style locators with auto-retry, auto-waiting expectations, real pointer/touch/gesture input (click, drag, wheel, pinch, rotate), YAML script playback, screenshot/region/control snapshots (+ composite windows AND open pop-ups), drop-down driving (open + select), GIF/MP4 recording, an interactive REPL and an MCP server. HeadlessRender.SettleAsync realizes deferred/virtualized/animated content before capture — including drag-driven Dock docking/splitting.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
