  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.7.1: no functional changes from 1.7.0 — versioned for lucidVIEW v4.2.0 editor integration. 1.7.0: drop-down support — OpenDropDown + SelectDropDownItem actions drive ComboBox/AutoCompleteBox lists deterministically; Composite screenshots now capture open pop-ups; TypeText now targets AutoCompleteBox and any control wrapping a TextBox.",
